        "original_id": "fb74ce3c-08df-5e5c-94ff-95610cdf8351",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Films: Return to Oz, Midnight Madness\n- People: Walter Murch, Gill Dennis, Paul Maslansky, David Naughton, Stephen Furst, Maggie Roswell, David Shire\n- Companies: Walt Disney Productions\n- Roles: director, writer, producer, editor, sound designer, composer\n- Works: The Wizard of Oz, Baby, Closer Than Ever, Starting Here, Starting Now\n\nFacts:\n- Midnight Madness is a 1980 American comedy film produced by Walt Disney Productions and starring David Naughton, Stephen Furst, and Maggie Roswell.\n- Return to Oz is a 1985 fantasy adventure film directed and written by Walter Murch.\n- Walter Murch was also an editor and sound designer, and Gill Dennis co-wrote Return to Oz.\n- Paul Maslansky produced Return to Oz.\n- David Shire composed the score for the 1985 film Return to Oz, which is described as a sequel-in-part to The Wizard of Oz.\n- David Shire's other work includes the stage musical scores for Baby, Closer Than Ever, and Starting Here, Starting Now.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
